{"id":"vod_md_2331","vodId":"2331","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"食梦者","name_cn":"食梦者","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230812-1/01f72e6633a49c726a0b36a2917be234.jpg"},"summary":"真城最高（阿部敦 配音）是一个在绘画方面极有天赋的少年，年纪虽小却已经获得了大臣的认可和赏识。可是，从事漫画行业的叔叔之死让他放弃了创作漫画的梦想，封闭起心灵，过起了得过且过的放浪生活，直到好友高木秋人（日野聪 配音）出现在了他的面前。秋人的梦想是成为一名漫画家，可是，在文学创作上独树一帜他却对漫画一窍不通，在得知了高城的过去后，他向高城发出了邀请：“我写剧本，你创作，让我们成为漫画家吧！”虽然高城心里有千百个不情愿，无奈自己暗恋同班同学亚豆美保（早见沙织 配音）的把柄抓在秋人手上，就这样，两人踏上了成为漫画家的修罗之路，而高城对漫画的热爱也慢慢的被重新点燃了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-12 08:30:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/rPPGIqEM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/vj4h2Ea1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/yZioYcIL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/VmAkI42L/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/CruHsP75/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/JPbTwUEN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/dLaminCZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/hlpb5F1M/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/oZD2Mjq6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/UJmJCSoT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/TZsSYBJq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/I8exvEcE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/Bo2pgH7q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/z1cYNOj7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230811/0CzAyFUo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集",